What this licence covers

This licence covers the files under linux/ that the Thimsy OS project wrote,
except:

- linux/gpl/, which is licensed separately: each item there carries its own
  licence (GPL-2.0 for the kernel, U-Boot and device-tree patches and for the
  files imported from ROCKNIX, GPL-3.0 for the RetroArch patches, zlib for the
  SDL patches; see linux/gpl/README.md and linux/gpl/COPYING);
- files that FlipBase brings with its subtree merge (decisions D19 and I42).
  FlipBase's own licence and notice files are kept beside this one at that
  merge, as LICENSE.FlipBase and NOTICE, because MIT requires its notice in
  every copy; the BaseOS-derived files that FlipBase's NOTICE names are under
  the licences that NOTICE gives, not under this file.

The rest of the repository outside linux/ is under the Apache License 2.0 (the
repository's LICENSE), and libthimsy/ under its own MIT licence. Packages that
Buildroot builds keep their own licences, which `make legal-info` lists.
